&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Co-Marketing Execution&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and execute partner co-marketing campaigns across channels including owned social, email, in-product placements, and live events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain marketing &quot;playbooks&quot; and repeatable program templates that support consistency and faster time-to-launch across partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support GTM planning for partner moments (new product launches, integrations, tentpole game releases), helping prepare materials and recommendations for review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with partners&#39; marketing counterparts on creative direction, promotional timing, approvals, and campaign deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Cross-Functional Program Coordination&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide day-to-day program support for Commerce partners, helping keep always-on promotions running smoothly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Developer Solutions, Advertising, Commerce, PMM, and Channel Marketing teams to track timelines, deliverables, and responsibilities for partner-facing programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain project timelines, flag dependencies and risks, and help facilitate regular syncs with internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain intake and request-tracking workflows (e.g., via Salesforce and Asana) so partner marketing requests are logged, prioritized, and actioned consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development of B2B marketing collateral and presentations in partnership with Product Marketing and Consumer Marketing teams (newsletters, blog posts, case study amplification).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help coordinate partner workshops, innovation days, QBR presentations, and industry summits, using established frameworks and templates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Optimization&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track campaign performance against business KPIs — including revenue supported, daily account linked players (DALP), and Commerce GMV — and help synthesize insights for the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain a partner marketing roadmap that shows program activity and status for cross-functional visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flag recurring friction points (e.g., one-off approval requests, low-priority asks) to help the team improve processes over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
