&lt;li&gt;Experience with some parts of our tech stack. This is mainly Python and Typescript/React, but could include Elixir, Rust, or C++. You are comfortable switching across stacks or learning new ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building software that leverages large data based applications. Data plays a huge part in the work that we do and how we support our developer partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a sense for product and design. We don’t operate in silos, and you’ll be collaborating closely with cross-functional peers. You should be able to express opinions and collaborate to make something great.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A holistic approach to problem solving. You believe in solving a problem from first principles rather than simply shipping a solution. You learn from your mistakes and work through obstacles with the rest of the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You actively leverage AI coding tools to accelerate your productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
