&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with mobile development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience leveraging a cloud platform (eg GCP, Amazon, or Azure) to serve as the backend infrastructure for a product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus bonus points: Experience with game development.&lt;/li&gt;
