&lt;li&gt;Highly proficient with APEX, Lightning Web Components (LWC), Visualforce, and Salesforce&#39;s declarative tools (Flows, Process Builder, Validation Rules).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting Ad Sales workflows right from inception to delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience architecting integrations using REST/SOAP APIs, Middleware, and tools like MuleSoft or similar platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
