&lt;li&gt;You are proficient in Python and SQL. Experience with Typescript or Rust is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and with and/or exposure to a variety of datastores (relational, NoSQL, data warehouse solutions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product sense and communication skills - you understand your customers and work well cross-functionally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of developing engineers at multiple levels, and a habit of tracking industry trends to bring new techniques to technical problems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
